      "content": "financial advisors? i can't even afford to buy groceries right now let alone pay someone to look at my debt. it's not just a 'rough patch' anymore. it's like i've failed at everything. my family is going to be so ashamed when they realize what happened. everything i worked for is just useless. there's no 'plan' for when you're literally at zero.",
