      "content": "it just feels like a loop that never ends. i'm just so tired of the panic every morning. even if i get food assistance, i'm still a failure. the debt will just follow me forever. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise and the shame is to just... not be here anymore. does that even make sense? everything just feels so heavy and useless.",
